<title>ITALY: IFIL and Auchan to form new retail group.</title>
<headline>IFIL and Auchan to form new retail group.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agnelli family holding company IFIL and French retail group Auchan said on Tuesday they are to form a new retail grouping, owned 51 percent by IFIL and 49 percent by Auchan.</p>
<p>An IFIL statement said that IFIL will transfer its 40.5 percent stake in Italy's largest quoted retailer Rinascente to the new grouping.</p>
